## vendor/xenova-transformers/ — removed 2026-08-16

Portions of Transformers.js were vendored here from the week-one baseline
(`a49f4c5`) and never imported by anything: the embedder runs
`scripts/embed_minilm.py` against `models/minilm/` via onnxruntime, and a
search of the tree outside `vendor/` found references only in this file, in
`benchmarks/BENCHMARK.md` and in an eslint ignore rule.

So the directory carried live obligations for no function — Apache-2.0
redistribution, a dependency surface `npm audit` and Dependabot cannot see, and
a recorded upstream revision of `UNIDENTIFIED`, which meant no advisory could
ever be evaluated against it. Deleted rather than documented. It remains in git
history at any commit before this one, still under Apache-2.0.

## models/minilm/

Model weights (model_quantized.onnx, ~23 MB) derived from
sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2, licensed under Apache-2.0.
See models/minilm/VERSION for the source revision and file hashes.
